//! Current keyboard reference. Controls and shortcuts have the same action paths.
pub(super) const HELP: &str = "Navigation\nArrows or j/k: select or scroll the current region\nTab / Shift+Tab: focus and cycle workspace action buttons\nEnter: open selected evidence or activate an ordinary focused button\nEsc: leave actions, close a reader/layer, or toggle the sidebar\nh or ?: Help · H: recorded activity\n1 Activity · 2 Artifacts · 3 Edits · s Overview\n.: More actions · overview o: final report · overview e: full result\nf: browse/search sessions · n: choose workflow, enter goal, start\nSession rows are candidates; Enter/Open selected switches workspace\nBack/Esc cancels browsing; Clear search resets the filter\nSearch letters/paste stay literal; arrows select candidates\ni: compose on demand · Esc closes and retains draft\n\nDecisions\nAll valid grant choices appear in each typed approval.\nUse the displayed decision key or click its row; Enter never decides.\nHuman checkpoint: Tab/Shift+Tab cycles documents; Enter/e opens evidence.\nEvidence reader: y/n are inert; Esc returns to the review.\nh opens Help above a pending approval. No decision keys work here.\nEsc closes Help only; Esc in the approval itself denies.\nRevert/restart: y confirms; n/Esc cancels. Enter is inert.\n\nEvidence and actions\nC: copy full selected text · E: external snapshot editor (idle only)\nc: run overview · Technical details opens recorded context\n/dump or More > Conversation dump: recorded transcript; R refreshes, w saves full file\n/usage or More > Usage: session token/cost summary\nRequest details: arrows/j/k select · Enter/click opens exact dispatch\nBack/Esc returns within details, then to the workspace\nF: filter activity · v: raw events / artifact versions\no: exact artifact version · p: provenance · d: previous/journal diff\nm: artifact Markdown/raw · u/U: file/all recorded revert preview\nEdits: Tab cycles All files/files; Enter focuses actions, Esc returns\nKeep file/all saves revision review; files are already applied\nKeep is not a tool grant, correctness check or Git staging\ne: blocker evidence · b: blocker card · r: restart preview\nEnd/G: follow latest activity · Home/g: pause at first\nP: show/hide live preview · Z: expand/collapse preview\nx: stop future requests/retry waits; in-flight request may finish\n\nText editing\nArrows move the caret; Home/End and Delete/Backspace edit.\nEnter sends/starts · Ctrl+J or Alt+Enter: newline\nLetters h/j/k and pasted text stay literal while typing.\nPaste never sends; blue is user input. Focused carets blink.\nDrafts are memory-only, scoped by session, branch and recipient.\nChange recipient selects manager or step; navigation / opens Commands.\nSlash-prefixed text in message modes stays literal.\nClosing an editor does not send it.\n\nMouse\nClick buttons/rows to open; scroll with the wheel.\nM toggles mouse capture here for terminal text selection.\nNo function keys are required.\n\nReading and exit\nPgUp/PgDn: page · Home/End: top/bottom\nLive output and model claims are not executed/verified evidence.\nArtifact revisions are documents; Edits covers native recorded writes.\n/resume continues ready/blocked work; /recover never resumes it.\n/ask QUESTION asks the read-only manager; routes do not execute.\nq quits only when there is no local worker/manager job.\n";
